# Purpose

This document defines the architecture of the BestWayGrow Franchise Application system.

The Franchise Application Architecture manages the complete lifecycle of a franchise application, beginning from applicant submission, information collection, verification, review, approval processing, and final franchise account creation.

The application process is controlled under the Admin Franchise management system to ensure secure, transparent, and verified franchise onboarding.

---

# Objectives

The Franchise Application Architecture is designed to:

- Provide structured franchise onboarding
- Collect required applicant information
- Enable admin verification
- Maintain application history
- Prevent unauthorized franchise creation
- Provide complete application tracking
- Support future franchise expansion

