Layer Summary
The Franchise Application Architecture establishes the secure onboarding foundation for the BestWayGrow Franchise ecosystem.
It ensures that every franchise application follows a controlled verification process, receives proper administrative approval, creates a valid franchise account, and integrates securely with financial, inventory, dashboard, and audit systems.
